- The sandbox application. Runs untrusted code, talks to the host only by
- postMessage. Knows nothing about Giper Baza, the network or user keys.
- @see ../ARCHITECTURE.md section 4

$bog_vmap_scene $mol_view
	attr *
		^
		bog_vmap_scene_mode <= mode \edit
	sub /
		<= Stage $mol_view
			style *
				transform <= camera_transform \none
			sub <= stage /$mol_view_content
	-
	- Stated wait instead of an empty canvas: a cold pack is 2.25 MB and 610 ms,
	- and a blank frame for that long reads as a breakage.
	Wait $mol_view
		sub /
			<= pack_note \
